    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone. Abandoned on top of a mountain. No map. No guidance. No help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only goal is simple: <strong>get down alive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the Summit of Mount Rojerya</strong> offers a raw survival experience with no user interface, no hints, and no narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore carefully. Observe your surroundings. There is only one correct path.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are alone. Abandoned on top of a mountain. No map. No guidance. No help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only goal is simple: <strong>get down alive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>At the Summit of Mount Rojerya</strong> offers a raw survival experience with no user interface, no hints, and no narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore carefully. Observe your surroundings. There is only one correct path.</p>",
    "short_description": "Survive a deadly descent from a mountain peak. One wrong step ends it all. Be slow, focused, and patient caution is your only ally in this unforgiving journey. There\u2019s no map, no help just you, your instincts, and the will to make it out alive. One mistake, and it\u2019s all over.",
